#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_record__trainee_confirmed
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_training_record_form_process
msgid "The learner confirms"
msgstr "L'apprenant confirme"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_process_lane_form_training
msgid ""
"The map names the role; it does not know who holds it. Filling in\n"
"                        the people lets a training requirement target this\n"
"                        lane rather than a list of names copied out by hand."
msgstr ""
"La carte nomme le rôle ; elle ne sait pas qui le tient. Renseigner\n"
"                        les personnes permet à une exigence de formation de viser ce\n"
"                        couloir plutôt qu'une liste de noms recopiée à la main."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_requirement__lane_id
msgid "The role targeted, as it is drawn on the map."
msgstr "Le rôle visé, tel qu'il est dessiné sur la carte."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_activity__process_lane_ids
msgid "The roles that carry out at least one of the steps taught."
msgstr "Les rôles qui tiennent au moins une des étapes enseignées."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_record__process_node_id
msgid "The task the training covered."
msgstr "Le geste sur lequel l'entraînement a porté."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_activity__process_node_ids
msgid ""
"The tasks this training teaches people to carry out. One training activity "
"can cover several steps, and one step can require several activities."
msgstr ""
"Les gestes que cette formation apprend à tenir. Une formation peut couvrir "
"plusieurs étapes, et une étape peut en demander plusieurs."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_training_activity_form_process
msgid ""
"The tasks this training teaches people to carry out. The lanes\n"
"                        involved follow from them: they are the roles that carry out at\n"
"                        least one of these steps."
msgstr ""
"Les gestes que cette formation apprend à tenir. Les couloirs\n"
"                        concernés s'en déduisent : ce sont les rôles qui tiennent au\n"
"                        moins une de ces étapes."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_training_process.field_bf_training_record__trainer_confirmed
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_training_record_form_process
msgid "The trainer confirms"
msgstr "Le formateur confirme"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_process_node_form_training
msgid "Training"
msgstr "Formation"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_process_lane_form_training
msgid "Training activities"
msgstr "Formations"

#. module: bf_training_process
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training_process/models/process_lane.py:0
msgid "Training activities for the lane"
msgstr "Formations du couloir"

#. module: bf_training_process
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_training_process/models/process_node.py:0
msgid "Training activities for the step"
msgstr "Formations de l'étape"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_training_process.field_bf_process_node__training_activity_ids
msgid "Training required by this step"
msgstr "Formations exigées par cette étape"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_process_node_form_training
msgid ""
"What you need to know to carry out this step. From there, the register\n"
"                        says who is up to date and who is not."
msgstr ""
"Ce qu'il faut savoir pour tenir cette étape. De là, le registre\n"
"                        dit qui est à jour et qui ne l'est pas."

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_training_process.view_process_lane_form_training
msgid "Who holds this role"
msgstr "Qui tient ce rôle"

#. module: bf_training_process
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_training_process.field_bf_process_lane__employee_ids
msgid ""
"Who plays this role today. A training requirement can target the lane rather"
" than copy out the names."
msgstr ""
"Qui joue ce rôle aujourd'hui. Une exigence de formation peut viser le "
"couloir plutôt que de recopier les noms."

#. module: bf_training_process
#. odoo-python
